I posted the bullets for your note to June as a reply in #coastal-team. Nothing has been sent to June.

The bullets cover:
- the topic (the PHL label confusion);
- the 16 Feb rename from Covey & Lark to Pellow Home Living;
- the saved report that still reads "Covey — Late Arrivals";
- the risk that people think "Covey" and PHL are different accounts;
- an ask to confirm the right name for the report and who updates it.

I didn't check Moss's digest myself. The bullets only repeat what you told me. If you want a mail draft to June, tell me.
